# Use the image CMD instead of replacing it with `sleep infinity`.
#
# /opt/start.sh boots Consul (ACL disabled = vulnerable) in the background so the
# HTTP API is LIVE for the anonymous-403 PoC, then execs `sleep infinity`.
# Enabling ACLs requires restarting Consul, so a solution that edits consul.hcl
# but does NOT restart still fails the check. Restarting Consul cannot kill the
# container because PID 1 remains `sleep infinity`.
